        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Huevos a la mexicana, Refried beans\n- Ingredients: Coriander leaves, Eggs, Salt, Beans\n- Cuisines: Mexican cuisine, Tex-Mex cuisine\n\nFacts:\n- In Huevos a la mexicana, the heat is turned off before coriander leaves are mixed into the eggs with salt.\n- Refried beans, called \"frijoles refritos\" in Spanish, are a dish of cooked and mashed beans.\n- Refried beans are a traditional staple of Mexican cuisine and Tex-Mex cuisine.\n- Mexican cuisine and Tex-Mex cuisine use different approaches when making refried beans.",
